!reset

[test session_stats]
# gen82: session statistics. The brain tracks turns and start time.
> hi there
< Hi there!
> how many turns have we exchanged?
< We've exchanged 2 turn(s).
> how long have we been talking?
< We've been talking for 0 second(s).

